{v_1 : tensor} |= (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≠ 0)
>>
Rule 11 (tensor should have a consistent shape across all dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_1, 0)
>>
Rule 12 (tensor must have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
