{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 14 (tensor must be valid for Hardswish activation)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 17 (tensor should have consistent dimensionality)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1
>>
